1
00:00:05,784 --> 00:00:07,291
(All characters, places, and organizations
in this drama are fictitious.)

2
00:00:07,316 --> 00:00:08,841
(Filming followed broadcast guidelines
for minors, some scenes used AI.)

3
00:00:22,519 --> 00:00:24,700
Did some mean older boys hit you?

4
00:00:24,725 --> 00:00:26,640
Did they bully you for money?

5
00:00:28,715 --> 00:00:30,403
Then why are you crying?

6
00:00:30,717 --> 00:00:33,500
I've never seen you cry like this, Gyeol.
What's wrong?

7
00:00:43,046 --> 00:00:45,353
(Episode 33)

8
00:00:53,957 --> 00:00:55,437
Are you okay now, Gyeol?

9
00:00:56,224 --> 00:00:58,681
Can you tell me why you were crying?

10
00:01:02,464 --> 00:01:06,426
Mu Jin, I have something to tell you.

11
00:01:09,490 --> 00:01:13,271
- Me?
- Yes. Man to man.

12
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:17,320
Can't you tell me?

13
00:01:17,477 --> 00:01:19,201
Does it have to be man to man?

14
00:01:19,410 --> 00:01:21,416
Yes, it has to be man to man.

15
00:01:23,583 --> 00:01:25,309
Sure. Absolutely.

16
00:01:25,944 --> 00:01:28,315
Look at you, putting me to good use.

17
00:01:28,444 --> 00:01:30,968
This is exactly what I'm here for.
So what should we do?

18
00:01:31,991 --> 00:01:33,200
Want to talk at my place?

19
00:01:33,225 --> 00:01:35,291
- Over something tasty?
- Yes.

20
00:01:37,374 --> 00:01:38,411
Gyeol.

21
00:01:39,857 --> 00:01:43,428
Then I'll go have a little talk
with your son.

22
00:01:43,977 --> 00:01:47,737
Please don't worry too much, ma'am.
Just give us a moment.

23
00:01:50,290 --> 00:01:51,541
Let's go.

24
00:01:52,295 --> 00:01:53,902
Should we order something?

25
00:02:10,057 --> 00:02:12,204
What on earth is going on, Han Gyeol?

26
00:02:22,351 --> 00:02:23,392
(Mu Jin)

27
00:02:23,417 --> 00:02:25,890
I'll hear him out and calm him down,

28
00:02:26,131 --> 00:02:29,884
then tell you everything,
so don't worry about a thing.

29
00:02:41,916 --> 00:02:44,847
Why were you crying so hard earlier?

30
00:02:47,177 --> 00:02:51,173
I met this weird man.

31
00:02:55,150 --> 00:02:57,824
A weird man?

32
00:02:59,284 --> 00:03:02,408
He said I'm his son.

33
00:03:02,777 --> 00:03:05,446
He said he's my real dad.

34
00:03:09,790 --> 00:03:11,625
He must be out of his mind.

35
00:03:12,808 --> 00:03:14,261
If I'd been there,

36
00:03:14,314 --> 00:03:16,483
I wouldn't have let him
get away with saying that.

37
00:03:16,604 --> 00:03:19,614
He said he met you too, Mu Jin.

38
00:03:21,331 --> 00:03:22,631
He met me?

39
00:03:24,158 --> 00:03:26,038
I don't remember that.

40
00:03:26,611 --> 00:03:30,606
He said he asked you to help him
take me away.

41
00:03:30,938 --> 00:03:34,186
What? Take you where?

42
00:03:34,211 --> 00:03:36,128
Help him with what?

43
00:03:36,303 --> 00:03:38,549
If he shows up again
spouting that nonsense,

44
00:03:38,835 --> 00:03:41,348
tell him I'll report him
for attempted child abduction.

45
00:03:42,171 --> 00:03:45,157
Don't get so worked up. Sit down.

46
00:03:48,177 --> 00:03:49,351
Sorry.

47
00:03:50,437 --> 00:03:52,484
I'm just so mad. That's all.

48
00:03:57,250 --> 00:03:58,581
It's hot.

49
00:04:01,104 --> 00:04:02,400
Thanks.

50
00:04:08,978 --> 00:04:11,089
So what did you say to him?

51
00:04:11,478 --> 00:04:15,276
I was so scared, I just ran to Mom.

52
00:04:16,517 --> 00:04:17,835
Good job.

53
00:04:18,080 --> 00:04:21,733
If anyone weird like that shows up again,
just run home.

54
00:04:22,063 --> 00:04:23,943
Or call me.

55
00:04:24,317 --> 00:04:30,126
But that man's not my real dad, is he?

56
00:04:30,591 --> 00:04:34,298
Gyeol, I'm your dad. Okay?

57
00:04:34,597 --> 00:04:36,664
I'm your real dad.

58
00:04:36,911 --> 00:04:40,256
That's how I see it. Don't you?

59
00:04:40,370 --> 00:04:41,635
I do too.

60
00:04:41,842 --> 00:04:44,976
I think you're my real dad too.

61
00:04:52,291 --> 00:04:58,371
Gyeol, what if you, your mom, me,
and the whole family just...

62
00:04:58,518 --> 00:05:00,358
moved far away, somewhere overseas...

63
00:05:04,935 --> 00:05:06,115
(Air Assault Unit Army Special Ops Set)

64
00:05:06,189 --> 00:05:10,104
- That's a military block set, right?
- Yeah.

65
00:05:10,770 --> 00:05:13,998
It can be a helicopter or a tank.
That's the one, right?

66
00:05:14,463 --> 00:05:16,176
Yeah, that's right. Why?

67
00:05:16,497 --> 00:05:18,007
Want to build it with me?

68
00:05:18,584 --> 00:05:21,047
Really?

69
00:05:34,841 --> 00:05:35,990
Give it here.

70
00:05:43,290 --> 00:05:44,750
He's just a kid.

71
00:05:45,111 --> 00:05:47,764
It's nothing serious,
so don't worry too much.

72
00:05:48,577 --> 00:05:52,467
Seriously, Han Gyeol.
You scared me to death.

73
00:05:54,631 --> 00:05:57,600
What a relief. My legs are shaking.

74
00:06:00,957 --> 00:06:02,354
Welcome.

75
00:06:05,059 --> 00:06:06,519
Hello.

76
00:06:07,750 --> 00:06:10,827
This is your first time here, isn't it?

77
00:06:11,707 --> 00:06:13,404
Feel free to look around.

78
00:06:13,590 --> 00:06:16,350
We're closing soon,
so everything's 30 percent off.

79
00:06:17,738 --> 00:06:19,623
Don't you recognize me, Gyu Rim?

80
00:06:24,364 --> 00:06:27,721
- Who...
- Lee Hyeon Beom.

81
00:06:27,835 --> 00:06:31,169
We were classmates at Jaewon Elementary
in fourth and fifth grade.

82
00:06:32,404 --> 00:06:33,669
Lee Hyeon Beom?

83
00:06:34,196 --> 00:06:38,516
The one who always stole my erasers?

84
00:06:41,627 --> 00:06:43,474
It is you, Hyeon Beom!

85
00:06:43,717 --> 00:06:46,439
It's been so long!

86
00:06:46,637 --> 00:06:49,032
Your face hasn't changed a bit
since we were kids.

87
00:06:49,144 --> 00:06:51,356
What are the odds of running into you?

88
00:06:51,844 --> 00:06:54,599
Did you know this was my shop
when you came in?

89
00:06:55,123 --> 00:06:56,178
I did.

90
00:06:56,784 --> 00:06:59,993
How did you know?
I've moved so many times.

91
00:07:00,831 --> 00:07:03,411
Are you a detective or something?

92
00:07:04,538 --> 00:07:06,438
Well, a friend of mine is one.

93
00:07:07,358 --> 00:07:09,839
It's so good to see you, Hyeon Beom.

94
00:07:10,484 --> 00:07:15,481
Today's not great,
but want to have lunch tomorrow?

95
00:07:16,150 --> 00:07:17,609
Are you married?

96
00:07:17,764 --> 00:07:19,276
Do you have kids?

97
00:07:20,810 --> 00:07:22,115
I have a son.

98
00:07:22,143 --> 00:07:25,963
I wasn't married, just engaged.

99
00:07:27,064 --> 00:07:30,786
You have a son, but you were only engaged?
What do you mean?

100
00:07:32,574 --> 00:07:36,148
Sorry. That can happen.

101
00:07:36,183 --> 00:07:39,052
You could've been engaged
and still had a son.

102
00:07:39,426 --> 00:07:40,932
I'm sorry, Hyeon Beom.

103
00:07:44,224 --> 00:07:47,443
My fiancée was Hye Jeong.

104
00:07:47,843 --> 00:07:49,363
You remember Lim Hye Jeong, right?

105
00:07:49,631 --> 00:07:53,416
She was in our class, and you two
went to middle school together.

106
00:08:01,104 --> 00:08:03,526
Lim Hye Jeong?

107
00:08:06,362 --> 00:08:09,475
Hye Jeong and I got engaged and had a son,

108
00:08:10,969 --> 00:08:14,414
and I took one syllable from her name
and one from mine,

109
00:08:14,741 --> 00:08:17,134
and named him Lee Jeong Hyeon. But...

110
00:08:19,571 --> 00:08:21,336
she thought I'd died in an accident,

111
00:08:22,203 --> 00:08:25,256
so she abandoned the baby
and left for the States with another man.

112
00:08:27,731 --> 00:08:30,658
I saw my son for the first time
in eight years,

113
00:08:32,225 --> 00:08:34,225
and though his name was changed
to Han Gyeol,

114
00:08:36,289 --> 00:08:38,709
he's grown up to be such a wonderful boy,

115
00:08:39,589 --> 00:08:44,179
so I came here to bow deeply
and thank you.

116
00:08:48,824 --> 00:08:54,484
Did you happen to meet my Gyeol...

117
00:08:56,097 --> 00:08:57,790
Did you meet my Gyeol earlier?

118
00:09:12,791 --> 00:09:15,509
You're just like Santa Claus, Mu Jin.

119
00:09:15,807 --> 00:09:18,256
- Santa Claus?
- Yes.

120
00:09:18,563 --> 00:09:20,513
I wanted a block set for Christmas...

121
00:09:20,538 --> 00:09:24,733
so badly that I begged Santa for one.

122
00:09:24,758 --> 00:09:26,718
Really?

123
00:09:27,205 --> 00:09:30,965
No wonder Santa got in touch with me.

124
00:09:31,064 --> 00:09:34,063
- Really? Awesome.
- Awesome.

125
00:09:37,891 --> 00:09:41,099
Meeting you is the luckiest thing
that's ever happened to me.

126
00:09:41,270 --> 00:09:44,194
Hey, I'm the lucky one.

127
00:09:44,464 --> 00:09:47,881
If it weren't for you,
could I have met your mom again?

128
00:09:48,050 --> 00:09:49,448
That's true.

129
00:09:51,144 --> 00:09:56,981
So, Gyeol, no matter what happens,
we stick together till the end.

130
00:09:57,162 --> 00:10:01,315
Until I die, your mom dies, you die,

131
00:10:02,068 --> 00:10:05,972
and the world really ends.
All the way to the end.

132
00:10:07,632 --> 00:10:08,739
Promise.

133
00:10:12,324 --> 00:10:13,426
Stamp it.

134
00:10:14,140 --> 00:10:17,594
Sign it. Copy it. Laminate it.

135
00:10:21,003 --> 00:10:25,093
Stamp it, sign it, copy it, laminate it.

136
00:10:25,204 --> 00:10:26,705
If you lie, you owe me
ten million dollars.

137
00:10:26,951 --> 00:10:29,648
If you lie, you'll be punished.

138
00:10:29,802 --> 00:10:31,210
I'll be watching.

139
00:10:35,861 --> 00:10:37,932
- I'm going to the bathroom.
- Okay.

140
00:10:43,588 --> 00:10:44,893
Hey, Gyu Rim.

141
00:10:45,396 --> 00:10:46,756
Is Gyeol doing okay?

142
00:10:48,064 --> 00:10:49,616
Of course he is.

143
00:10:50,622 --> 00:10:51,835
What about you?

144
00:10:52,864 --> 00:10:54,004
Why do you sound like that?

145
00:10:54,671 --> 00:10:56,879
I'm on my way to your place.

146
00:10:57,453 --> 00:11:00,434
Please take care of Gyeol, Mu Jin.
Don't let him get scared.

147
00:11:11,078 --> 00:11:13,820
Mu Jin, there's no toilet paper.

148
00:11:14,544 --> 00:11:16,614
Yeah, if you open
the cabinet behind you...

149
00:11:17,604 --> 00:11:20,421
Never mind, I'll get it for you. Hang on.

150
00:13:02,151 --> 00:13:04,075
Mu Jin, doesn't this look wrong?

151
00:13:04,795 --> 00:13:06,698
This one.

152
00:13:06,781 --> 00:13:08,985
The manual says that's the right one.

153
00:13:13,271 --> 00:13:15,456
Then what about this? Like this...

154
00:13:18,808 --> 00:13:20,783
Gyeol, keep working on it by yourself
for a bit.

155
00:13:20,951 --> 00:13:22,811
I'm going to run out and grab something.

156
00:13:23,039 --> 00:13:24,176
Okay.

157
00:13:59,856 --> 00:14:01,047
Gyu Rim.

158
00:14:04,994 --> 00:14:06,202
What's wrong?

159
00:14:09,646 --> 00:14:11,034
Did he come to see you too?

160
00:14:11,880 --> 00:14:13,059
Lee Hyeon Beom?

161
00:14:15,896 --> 00:14:17,477
That son of a bitch...

162
00:14:40,833 --> 00:14:44,760
Hey, if business keeps going like this,
we'll be rich in no time, right?

163
00:14:49,511 --> 00:14:52,704
I heard Min Ju's mom wanted to report you
and send you to jail,

164
00:14:52,871 --> 00:14:54,646
but Min Ju begged her not to.

165
00:14:54,671 --> 00:14:56,730
She even got a fistful
of her hair pulled out.

166
00:15:03,003 --> 00:15:05,216
Can you call Hui Na on your phone?

167
00:15:06,476 --> 00:15:07,697
Hui Na?

168
00:15:08,077 --> 00:15:09,357
Why not just use yours?

169
00:15:10,977 --> 00:15:12,827
I deleted her number.

170
00:15:14,588 --> 00:15:18,814
You don't forget your girlfriend's number
just because you deleted it.

171
00:15:22,617 --> 00:15:24,171
I think she blocked my number.

172
00:15:28,931 --> 00:15:30,166
Okay.

173
00:15:37,802 --> 00:15:40,218
The call cannot be connected
and will be forwarded to voicemail...

174
00:15:41,720 --> 00:15:43,257
She's not picking up my calls either.

175
00:15:49,595 --> 00:15:52,205
The call cannot be connected
and will be forwarded to voicemail.

176
00:15:52,205 --> 00:15:54,703
Charges will apply after the beep.

177
00:15:56,717 --> 00:15:57,971
Kwon Hui Na.

178
00:15:59,682 --> 00:16:00,915
It's me, Han Gyu O.

179
00:16:03,318 --> 00:16:05,111
I think you've got something mixed up.

180
00:16:06,463 --> 00:16:08,469
I'm the one who ruined us, not you.

181
00:16:11,153 --> 00:16:14,966
It was my messed-up past that broke us up
and dragged you through the mud.

182
00:16:15,666 --> 00:16:18,367
So stop feeling guilty
about dumping me or hurting me,

183
00:16:18,392 --> 00:16:19,887
and quit acting like you're sick.

184
00:16:20,785 --> 00:16:22,057
Who do you think you are?

185
00:16:22,770 --> 00:16:24,631
Who are you to dump me?

186
00:16:24,656 --> 00:16:26,273
You think you're that great?

187
00:16:26,384 --> 00:16:28,124
When you're dead broke
with nothing to your name?

188
00:16:28,804 --> 00:16:30,829
If I hear any more strange rumors
about you,

189
00:16:31,423 --> 00:16:34,550
I'll come find you and humiliate you,
so if you don't want any more trouble,

190
00:16:35,892 --> 00:16:37,572
get your act together and live right.

191
00:16:38,234 --> 00:16:39,677
And stop making a fuss.

192
00:16:49,066 --> 00:16:50,463
You're driving me crazy,

193
00:16:52,817 --> 00:16:54,408
so please don't be sick.

194
00:17:01,451 --> 00:17:02,915
Don't be too shocked.

195
00:17:07,144 --> 00:17:08,810
We can handle this.

196
00:17:11,621 --> 00:17:13,451
It's something we can fix.

197
00:17:15,610 --> 00:17:17,080
No matter what anyone says,

198
00:17:18,586 --> 00:17:20,160
Gyeol is your son. No,

199
00:17:22,023 --> 00:17:23,425
he's our son.

200
00:17:44,243 --> 00:17:45,978
No way. What's this?

201
00:17:46,240 --> 00:17:47,508
Awesome.

202
00:17:47,657 --> 00:17:49,254
You already got this far?

203
00:17:50,183 --> 00:17:51,367
Is this for real?

204
00:17:51,877 --> 00:17:54,001
I think I'm a genius, Mu Jin.

205
00:17:54,531 --> 00:17:56,692
No. You're not a genius.

206
00:17:56,879 --> 00:17:58,538
A genius? No,

207
00:17:58,759 --> 00:18:01,943
that's far too small a word
to describe you.

208
00:18:02,437 --> 00:18:03,658
Gyeol.

209
00:18:04,281 --> 00:18:05,624
Are you from outer space, by any chance?

210
00:18:07,831 --> 00:18:09,275
No, seriously.

211
00:18:10,319 --> 00:18:13,663
I used to hear that my brain
wasn't human too,

212
00:18:14,041 --> 00:18:16,332
and get asked, "What planet are you from?"

213
00:18:16,704 --> 00:18:19,284
Maybe we're from the same planet.

214
00:18:19,393 --> 00:18:23,715
Actually, I've been asked that a lot too.

215
00:18:24,317 --> 00:18:25,734
Gyu Min did,

216
00:18:25,921 --> 00:18:28,882
Gyu O did, Da Som did,

217
00:18:29,182 --> 00:18:31,172
and so did the Class 3 teacher.

218
00:18:31,594 --> 00:18:33,077
No way.

219
00:18:33,840 --> 00:18:37,894
Then, Gyeol, have you heard
of the M78 Nebula?

220
00:18:38,723 --> 00:18:40,306
Yes, I've heard of it.

221
00:18:40,841 --> 00:18:42,751
It's Ultraman's home.

222
00:18:43,007 --> 00:18:44,447
I knew you'd know.

223
00:18:46,631 --> 00:18:49,098
I'm not sure what you'll think,

224
00:18:49,759 --> 00:18:51,208
and I was worried other people
would think it was strange,

225
00:18:51,233 --> 00:18:54,108
so I've never said it out loud before.

226
00:18:55,337 --> 00:18:59,119
I think I came from that planet.

227
00:18:59,197 --> 00:19:02,070
And from what I vaguely remember,

228
00:19:02,537 --> 00:19:06,609
I think I had a son
who looked exactly like you.

229
00:19:07,511 --> 00:19:09,187
No way. Really?

230
00:19:09,212 --> 00:19:11,891
Yeah. Look. Look at my face.

231
00:19:12,493 --> 00:19:16,188
You and I look alike
in lots of little ways.

232
00:19:18,251 --> 00:19:21,811
Everyone in this building
thinks you're my son.

233
00:19:30,698 --> 00:19:31,998
Gyu Rim.

234
00:19:37,594 --> 00:19:39,165
What are you doing here?

235
00:19:42,728 --> 00:19:44,194
Want some too?

236
00:20:14,698 --> 00:20:15,983
Did something happen?

237
00:20:29,482 --> 00:20:30,757
What is it?

238
00:20:46,698 --> 00:20:49,115
Okay. When you don't feel like talking,

239
00:20:50,664 --> 00:20:52,024
let's just not talk.

240
00:21:19,783 --> 00:21:20,991
Hey.

241
00:21:24,474 --> 00:21:27,507
What kind of stunt is this now?

242
00:21:29,057 --> 00:21:31,204
My dad said he saw it himself.

243
00:21:31,434 --> 00:21:33,139
Someone who died by sticking their head
in a bowl of water.

244
00:21:35,897 --> 00:21:37,972
And you believe that?

245
00:21:38,212 --> 00:21:41,077
How did you get a PhD
with a brain like that?

246
00:21:52,580 --> 00:21:54,330
Why? Who is it?

247
00:21:55,578 --> 00:21:58,266
Seong Uk? Didn't he get charged?

248
00:21:59,047 --> 00:22:00,882
Someone scarier than Kang Seong Uk.

249
00:22:11,831 --> 00:22:13,676
I said I'll pay it back.
Who said I wouldn't?

250
00:22:13,701 --> 00:22:15,864
I said I'd pay it back
as soon as possible.

251
00:22:19,211 --> 00:22:20,585
Yes, sir.

252
00:22:20,821 --> 00:22:23,068
Did I just raise my voice at you?

253
00:22:23,934 --> 00:22:25,617
I'm sorry.

254
00:22:25,957 --> 00:22:29,979
I've been under a lot of stress lately,
so I guess I wasn't thinking straight.

255
00:22:31,490 --> 00:22:32,736
Yes, of course.

256
00:22:33,008 --> 00:22:36,011
But if you give me just a little time,

257
00:22:36,154 --> 00:22:38,153
I'll even break my nephew's piggy bank...

258
00:22:40,775 --> 00:22:42,865
Yes, that was a joke.

259
00:22:43,391 --> 00:22:47,928
Anyway, I'll do whatever it takes
to pay you back soon...

260
00:22:51,171 --> 00:22:52,670
Yes, of course.

261
00:22:52,803 --> 00:22:56,908
I know the interest keeps growing
at an astronomical rate.

262
00:22:58,132 --> 00:22:59,760
Yes, sir.

263
00:22:59,785 --> 00:23:02,383
Sounds like your black bean noodles
are here, so enjoy your meal,

264
00:23:03,011 --> 00:23:05,938
and I'll call you
as soon as I have the money.

265
00:23:06,665 --> 00:23:08,029
Thank you.

266
00:23:20,689 --> 00:23:22,987
Did you borrow money from a loan company?

267
00:23:29,318 --> 00:23:32,216
You've got some nerve, girl.

268
00:23:32,648 --> 00:23:33,919
How much did you borrow?

269
00:23:34,653 --> 00:23:36,430
Why? Will you lend me some if I tell you?

270
00:23:36,455 --> 00:23:37,815
Do I look like I have money to burn?

271
00:23:37,924 --> 00:23:39,773
Then get your hand off me!

272
00:23:40,371 --> 00:23:42,869
Seriously!

273
00:23:47,651 --> 00:23:51,621
Honestly, I don't even care if I die.

274
00:23:51,978 --> 00:23:53,987
But would that be the end of it?

275
00:23:54,151 --> 00:23:58,148
Those guys would go after Gyu Rim, Gyu O,
and the twins over my debt,

276
00:23:58,381 --> 00:24:01,086
and get their money back no matter what!

277
00:24:01,111 --> 00:24:05,890
Then why do something
that would make your family suffer too?

278
00:24:05,915 --> 00:24:08,297
I thought I'd pay it off fast
once I married into a rich family!

279
00:24:08,404 --> 00:24:11,077
If you were a guy,
I'd smack you upside the head.

280
00:24:11,172 --> 00:24:13,436
Just give me a good smack...

281
00:24:15,434 --> 00:24:16,867
Can't you lend me some money?

282
00:24:23,361 --> 00:24:26,205
I can't do my business
with you watching me, kid.

283
00:24:27,437 --> 00:24:30,056
Hey, am I dying or something?

284
00:24:30,307 --> 00:24:34,189
Let's talk outside after I'm done, okay?

285
00:24:35,738 --> 00:24:37,267
Just hand me the toilet paper. Hurry.

286
00:24:38,557 --> 00:24:40,168
Not until you promise.

287
00:24:40,193 --> 00:24:41,764
What is it, then?

288
00:24:41,789 --> 00:24:43,704
It'd better be important.

289
00:24:46,204 --> 00:24:48,298
The woman who gave birth
to Gyu Min and me.

290
00:24:49,184 --> 00:24:50,397
No,

291
00:24:50,968 --> 00:24:55,065
what if the woman who claims she's our mom
comes back?

292
00:24:56,217 --> 00:24:58,486
What are you talking about, kid?

293
00:24:58,511 --> 00:25:01,507
I'm asking what you'll do
if she wants to live with you again.

294
00:25:01,690 --> 00:25:03,946
What do you think?

295
00:25:03,971 --> 00:25:05,221
If I had my way,

296
00:25:05,246 --> 00:25:08,447
I'd lock her up a dozen times over,
but how could I?

297
00:25:08,733 --> 00:25:10,093
She's still your mother.

298
00:25:12,823 --> 00:25:14,510
Hey, give me the toilet paper, kid!

299
00:25:19,947 --> 00:25:21,681
Put her in jail.

300
00:25:21,988 --> 00:25:25,008
She ran off with the head of accounting
and took everything we had!

301
00:25:25,137 --> 00:25:26,614
She's a criminal!

302
00:25:28,337 --> 00:25:31,735
I know you're not great at studying,

303
00:25:32,009 --> 00:25:34,747
but surely you've heard
of the statute of limitations?

304
00:25:35,398 --> 00:25:38,750
It's expired,
so I can't put her in jail, kid!

305
00:25:38,831 --> 00:25:40,898
Then why didn't you do it back then?

306
00:25:41,128 --> 00:25:44,326
- When she conned us and ran off, why...
- Because she's your mom.

307
00:25:44,351 --> 00:25:46,808
Mom? She's no mom!

308
00:25:47,927 --> 00:25:51,822
If she ever comes back,
don't let her set foot in this house.

309
00:25:51,934 --> 00:25:54,157
Even if she gets on her knees and begs,

310
00:25:54,227 --> 00:25:55,705
don't go easy on her,

311
00:25:56,410 --> 00:25:59,015
don't forgive her,
and don't even look at her.

312
00:25:59,040 --> 00:26:01,680
Hey, don't worry.

313
00:26:01,718 --> 00:26:04,174
How could she have the nerve
to show her face here?

314
00:26:04,224 --> 00:26:06,192
No human being would do that!

315
00:26:06,217 --> 00:26:07,750
She's not human.

316
00:26:08,411 --> 00:26:12,654
Gyu Min even said
that she and I are half-human, half-beast.

317
00:26:14,372 --> 00:26:16,817
Anyway, just promise me.

318
00:26:17,651 --> 00:26:20,651
Promise you won't be swayed
no matter what she says.

319
00:26:20,872 --> 00:26:22,283
You have to promise me.

320
00:26:24,485 --> 00:26:25,757
Gyu Seo.

321
00:26:27,024 --> 00:26:30,598
I was once a reed
that swayed whichever way the wind blew,

322
00:26:30,855 --> 00:26:32,771
but not anymore. Okay?

323
00:26:33,073 --> 00:26:38,412
Now I'm a pine tree
with roots deep in the ground.

324
00:26:40,185 --> 00:26:41,369
Or bamboo?

325
00:26:41,489 --> 00:26:43,747
Anyway, it's one of the two.

326
00:26:44,097 --> 00:26:49,557
And this time, I've met a woman
who's really stolen my heart.

327
00:26:50,934 --> 00:26:52,418
She runs a sashimi restaurant,

328
00:26:52,443 --> 00:26:55,083
and you love sashimi, don't you?

329
00:26:55,571 --> 00:27:00,552
I never had the money
to buy you all the sashimi you wanted,

330
00:27:00,767 --> 00:27:05,478
but now you can eat it for free
till you burst, kid!

331
00:27:06,117 --> 00:27:08,102
You hit the jackpot, kid!

332
00:27:08,271 --> 00:27:10,234
Lucky you!

333
00:27:17,425 --> 00:27:18,816
Were you just with Han Gyu Yeong?

334
00:27:19,859 --> 00:27:21,157
Yeah, well...

335
00:27:22,118 --> 00:27:25,677
She didn't seem to have eaten anything,
so I brought her some dumplings.

336
00:27:26,264 --> 00:27:28,149
Stop being nice to her.

337
00:27:28,271 --> 00:27:31,348
She'll just use you.
She doesn't know how to be grateful.

338
00:27:32,170 --> 00:27:33,334
No.

339
00:27:33,432 --> 00:27:35,230
You don't know her well,

340
00:27:35,398 --> 00:27:39,219
but your sister isn't
as nasty as you think.

341
00:27:41,538 --> 00:27:44,549
She needs to fall apart even more
before she comes to her senses.

342
00:27:45,802 --> 00:27:47,229
Han Gyu Yeong is a lost cause.

343
00:27:52,976 --> 00:27:55,628
Lost causes happen to be my specialty.

344
00:28:01,336 --> 00:28:03,755
Gyu Rim?

345
00:28:11,171 --> 00:28:12,778
What are you doing out here?

346
00:28:14,619 --> 00:28:16,518
I didn't want to go home.

347
00:28:17,291 --> 00:28:19,151
Gyeol's not home tonight.

348
00:28:19,945 --> 00:28:21,196
Gyeol's not home?

349
00:28:22,656 --> 00:28:26,101
He said he wanted to sleep
at Mu Jin's place tonight.

350
00:28:29,632 --> 00:28:30,878
Were you crying?

351
00:28:32,426 --> 00:28:35,792
No. It's because I had a drink.

352
00:28:36,057 --> 00:28:38,695
Gyu O was with me,
but he just went inside.

353
00:28:40,125 --> 00:28:41,682
Is Gyu O okay?

354
00:28:50,400 --> 00:28:52,195
How could he be okay?

355
00:29:03,998 --> 00:29:06,907
It's hard for me to be a river.

356
00:29:08,240 --> 00:29:09,735
Same for Gyu Seo.

357
00:29:10,586 --> 00:29:13,183
Whether it's the Yalu River
or the Nakdong River,

358
00:29:14,579 --> 00:29:16,664
we could never be a river.

359
00:29:17,932 --> 00:29:21,251
We're all just teacups and tiny dishes.

360
00:29:23,244 --> 00:29:25,217
But you're not a river, Gyu Rim.

361
00:29:27,637 --> 00:29:29,040
You're the sea.

362
00:29:30,591 --> 00:29:33,124
The sea where
all the rivers come together.

363
00:29:33,750 --> 00:29:35,730
A sea that took on every troublemaker...

364
00:29:37,076 --> 00:29:39,396
and weirdo, holding them all close,

365
00:29:40,643 --> 00:29:42,912
until it was bruised black and blue.

366
00:29:50,231 --> 00:29:54,341
That's why I look up to you so much,
and I think you're amazing,

367
00:29:57,677 --> 00:30:00,840
but I wish you didn't have to be
a river or the sea.

368
00:30:02,410 --> 00:30:05,927
I wish you'd put yourself first
and live like a tiny dish.

369
00:30:08,009 --> 00:30:09,516
Just a dish,

370
00:30:11,085 --> 00:30:12,440
like this,

371
00:30:14,273 --> 00:30:16,117
a tiny one no bigger than an acorn.

372
00:30:23,891 --> 00:30:26,902
Your hands are freezing.
Have you been out here long?

373
00:30:29,436 --> 00:30:30,824
Thank you, Gyu Min.

374
00:30:31,318 --> 00:30:32,982
I should be thanking you.

375
00:30:37,972 --> 00:30:42,002
As time went by, Gil Dong turned 11.

376
00:30:43,083 --> 00:30:44,985
Being so gifted,

377
00:30:45,028 --> 00:30:47,220
he was praised by everyone,

378
00:30:47,776 --> 00:30:51,103
but Gil Dong had a great sorrow.

379
00:30:52,403 --> 00:30:54,014
Because of his birth,

380
00:30:54,545 --> 00:30:57,193
he could not call his father "Father."

381
00:31:25,277 --> 00:31:27,417
- Where's little Han Gyeol?
- Asleep.

382
00:31:28,390 --> 00:31:30,234
What's wrong with me?

383
00:31:30,312 --> 00:31:33,218
I read to him without even checking
the title.

384
00:31:33,497 --> 00:31:34,951
What book did you read to him?

385
00:31:35,944 --> 00:31:37,411
Gyeol asked me to read it.

386
00:31:38,849 --> 00:31:39,909
(The Tale of Hong Gil Dong)

387
00:31:40,983 --> 00:31:43,483
The part where he can't call
his father "Father?"

388
00:31:44,163 --> 00:31:46,119
You idiot.

389
00:31:46,144 --> 00:31:47,857
Is that all there is to the story?

390
00:31:49,271 --> 00:31:51,013
Your mom gave you her blessing,

391
00:31:51,479 --> 00:31:54,166
so I thought it'd be smooth sailing
from now on, but...

392
00:31:54,559 --> 00:31:56,618
What's Gyu Rim going to do?

393
00:31:57,883 --> 00:32:00,364
Could she even survive losing Gyeol?

394
00:32:01,102 --> 00:32:04,470
She couldn't. No way.

395
00:32:05,347 --> 00:32:09,283
She could live without me,
but never without Gyeol.

396
00:32:10,438 --> 00:32:13,717
I won't let them take Gyeol.

397
00:32:16,084 --> 00:32:18,133
No matter what happens,
nobody's taking him from me.

398
00:32:19,237 --> 00:32:21,204
Even if they demand everything I own, no,

399
00:32:22,237 --> 00:32:24,611
even if they demand everything
my mother owns,

400
00:32:25,232 --> 00:32:26,895
I'm not letting them take Gyeol.

401
00:32:28,557 --> 00:32:30,313
Okay. If you need it,

402
00:32:30,348 --> 00:32:32,779
I'll even sell off my dad's abalone farm.

403
00:32:33,677 --> 00:32:34,867
Drink up.

404
00:32:37,063 --> 00:32:38,116
Thanks.

405
00:32:59,013 --> 00:33:00,592
(Eldest Daughter)

406
00:33:08,335 --> 00:33:09,517
Gyu Rim.

407
00:33:12,396 --> 00:33:13,490
Mom.

408
00:33:15,231 --> 00:33:18,602
Yes. It's me.

409
00:33:20,124 --> 00:33:21,612
It's your mom, Gyu Rim.

410
00:33:24,326 --> 00:33:28,407
I just wanted to hear your voice,

411
00:33:28,981 --> 00:33:30,306
so I called.

412
00:33:33,624 --> 00:33:35,237
Of course. I'm glad you did.

413
00:33:36,023 --> 00:33:37,357
Really glad.

414
00:33:38,664 --> 00:33:40,852
Thank you for calling, Gyu Rim.

415
00:33:43,911 --> 00:33:45,971
Where are you?

416
00:33:47,163 --> 00:33:50,970
I'm done at the restaurant.
Should I come to you now?

417
00:33:52,898 --> 00:33:54,095
No.

418
00:33:54,738 --> 00:33:56,984
It's too late tonight,

419
00:33:59,397 --> 00:34:04,124
so I'll come by your restaurant soon.

420
00:34:05,837 --> 00:34:07,411
I'll bring my son too.

421
00:34:09,364 --> 00:34:11,524
I want you to meet him, my Gyeol.

422
00:34:13,291 --> 00:34:14,291
Okay.

423
00:34:15,766 --> 00:34:17,008
Please come.

424
00:34:18,917 --> 00:34:20,276
Make sure you bring Gyeol too.

425
00:34:26,870 --> 00:34:29,172
Does Gyeol like meat?

426
00:34:32,694 --> 00:34:34,103
That's great.

427
00:34:35,118 --> 00:34:39,476
Tell Gyeol I'll grill him
some delicious meat.

428
00:34:42,296 --> 00:34:43,517
Okay.

429
00:34:44,907 --> 00:34:46,356
Thank you.

430
00:34:48,930 --> 00:34:50,721
Thank you, Mom.

431
00:36:47,867 --> 00:36:49,057
Aren't you going to say hi to your mom?

432
00:36:53,354 --> 00:36:54,517
Mom!

433
00:36:59,850 --> 00:37:02,005
- Did you sleep well at Mu Jin's?
- Yeah.

434
00:37:02,345 --> 00:37:04,907
I built the block set at his place,

435
00:37:04,932 --> 00:37:07,454
and he made me beef risotto.

436
00:37:07,810 --> 00:37:08,810
Really?

437
00:37:08,841 --> 00:37:09,841
- Yeah.
- Was it good?

438
00:37:09,930 --> 00:37:11,481
- Yeah.
- Gyeol.

439
00:37:12,018 --> 00:37:14,122
After sending you to my place,

440
00:37:14,243 --> 00:37:16,337
I guess your mom was so worried,
she didn't get a wink of sleep.

441
00:37:16,703 --> 00:37:18,531
Her big eyes got even bigger.

442
00:37:18,556 --> 00:37:20,534
She stayed up all night,
so now they're wide as saucers.

443
00:37:21,650 --> 00:37:23,468
Mom, let me see your face.

444
00:37:23,763 --> 00:37:25,935
- What?
- Quick.

445
00:37:29,677 --> 00:37:31,687
I'm fine. Really.

446
00:37:34,485 --> 00:37:35,869
No, you're not.

447
00:37:36,476 --> 00:37:39,143
Your big eyes got even wider.

448
00:37:39,449 --> 00:37:40,570
See?

449
00:37:43,510 --> 00:37:45,097
Let's go home and get ready for school.

450
00:37:45,122 --> 00:37:46,282
And change your clothes.

451
00:37:46,824 --> 00:37:49,388
Mu Jin's going to take me today instead.

452
00:37:49,637 --> 00:37:51,090
Go with your mom and change.

453
00:37:51,115 --> 00:37:52,135
I'll wait for you.

454
00:37:52,290 --> 00:37:53,965
Okay, thank you.

455
00:37:54,170 --> 00:37:55,170
Let's go.

456
00:38:04,930 --> 00:38:06,979
Why are you so nervous, Han Gyu Rim?

457
00:38:09,070 --> 00:38:11,191
And why are you tiptoeing around your son?

458
00:38:11,558 --> 00:38:12,837
It breaks my heart.

459
00:38:25,797 --> 00:38:27,404
- Mom.
- Yes?

460
00:38:28,817 --> 00:38:30,328
Why are you so startled?

461
00:38:32,210 --> 00:38:34,519
What? I'm not startled.

462
00:38:35,437 --> 00:38:39,847
I really scared you yesterday
when I cried, didn't I?

463
00:38:42,083 --> 00:38:43,083
Just...

464
00:38:44,897 --> 00:38:45,897
a little?

465
00:38:46,894 --> 00:38:49,766
Sorry for scaring you.

466
00:38:51,374 --> 00:38:52,561
It's okay.

467
00:38:52,857 --> 00:38:56,722
Your grandpa, aunts, and uncles
have scared me so many times,

468
00:38:56,972 --> 00:38:59,278
so it wasn't that big of a deal.

469
00:39:08,990 --> 00:39:11,313
You want to know why I cried, right?

470
00:39:18,570 --> 00:39:19,759
Why did you cry?

471
00:39:20,771 --> 00:39:23,052
I met this weird man,

472
00:39:23,413 --> 00:39:25,313
and I got really scared,

473
00:39:26,061 --> 00:39:30,003
but Mu Jin said he'll always protect me
and told me not to worry.

474
00:39:30,889 --> 00:39:35,282
He'll walk me to school every day too.

475
00:39:39,752 --> 00:39:40,944
Mom.

476
00:39:41,776 --> 00:39:45,092
- Yeah?
- But when do I become Kim Gyeol?

477
00:39:45,784 --> 00:39:47,676
When I asked Mu Jin,

478
00:39:47,701 --> 00:39:50,206
he told me to ask you.

479
00:40:10,110 --> 00:40:11,110
Sir?

480
00:40:11,690 --> 00:40:13,190
Son-in-law Kim?

481
00:40:14,164 --> 00:40:15,890
- How have you been?
- Good.

482
00:40:15,915 --> 00:40:17,121
I've been seeing you a lot lately.

483
00:40:17,291 --> 00:40:18,837
If you're here, why not come in?
Why are you standing out here?

484
00:40:18,862 --> 00:40:20,656
I was waiting for Gyeol.

485
00:40:20,963 --> 00:40:22,914
Gyeol? Not Gyu Rim?

486
00:40:23,550 --> 00:40:25,261
Not me, obviously.

487
00:40:29,491 --> 00:40:30,670
It was you, wasn't it, sir?

488
00:40:31,043 --> 00:40:32,043
What was?

489
00:40:32,237 --> 00:40:34,535
You called Gyeol a burden.

490
00:40:34,843 --> 00:40:35,843
It was you, right?

491
00:40:38,103 --> 00:40:42,306
Gyeol told you that?
That little tattletale.

492
00:40:43,204 --> 00:40:46,289
I could hardly believe it.
Are you really that kind of person, sir?

493
00:40:46,784 --> 00:40:48,398
How could you be so frightening,

494
00:40:48,534 --> 00:40:51,648
so cruel and cold with a child listening?

495
00:40:52,824 --> 00:40:56,133
I didn't say it in front of Gyeol.

496
00:40:56,730 --> 00:40:58,938
I was on the phone with a friend
and didn't know Gyeol was listening,

497
00:40:58,963 --> 00:41:02,958
so Gyu Rim really tore into me.

498
00:41:03,303 --> 00:41:04,624
I'm so disappointed in you.

499
00:41:04,649 --> 00:41:08,951
I've always been so grateful to you
for bringing Gyu Rim into the world,

500
00:41:08,976 --> 00:41:11,491
so I was going to devote myself,
body and soul,

501
00:41:11,670 --> 00:41:14,630
to treating you like a king
and taking good care of you.

502
00:41:16,924 --> 00:41:18,535
But I think I need to reconsider.

503
00:41:19,290 --> 00:41:21,492
Don't reconsider, son-in-law Kim.

504
00:41:21,855 --> 00:41:25,410
That thing. You have no idea how much I...

505
00:41:25,435 --> 00:41:27,770
regretted it and felt bad about it.

506
00:41:28,116 --> 00:41:30,206
I apologized to Gyeol and to Gyu Rim.

507
00:41:30,472 --> 00:41:32,062
I apologized over and over.

508
00:41:32,087 --> 00:41:36,173
Anyway, sir, if you ever hurt Gyeol again,

509
00:41:36,175 --> 00:41:39,150
I won't buy you meals anymore,

510
00:41:39,184 --> 00:41:40,553
or wine either.

511
00:41:40,701 --> 00:41:43,381
And I'll take back what I said earlier...

512
00:41:43,383 --> 00:41:45,777
about devoting myself to honoring you.

513
00:41:46,946 --> 00:41:51,291
Okay. I was actually on my way
to buy some ramen.

514
00:41:51,292 --> 00:41:53,438
Guess I'll buy some tofu too.

515
00:41:53,463 --> 00:41:55,961
I'll buy tofu and live a clean, pure life,

516
00:41:57,316 --> 00:41:58,628
bright and confident.

517
00:41:59,113 --> 00:42:00,433
Off to buy ramen.

518
00:42:12,736 --> 00:42:14,295
- Your bag.
- Yeah.

519
00:42:18,949 --> 00:42:20,652
I'm off to school.

520
00:42:21,498 --> 00:42:23,418
- Let's go, Mu Jin.
- Okay, let's go.

521
00:42:25,481 --> 00:42:27,994
- I'll park here for a sec.
- Okay.

522
00:42:33,877 --> 00:42:35,443
- Gyeol.
- Yes?

523
00:42:35,857 --> 00:42:38,664
Purple really looks good on you.
On me too, actually.

524
00:42:39,151 --> 00:42:40,324
Really?

525
00:42:40,458 --> 00:42:42,937
Was it the second time I met your mom?

526
00:42:42,939 --> 00:42:45,604
No, when we first met, she said
purple would look good on me.

527
00:42:45,704 --> 00:42:48,556
So I decided to wear purple the next day,

528
00:42:48,558 --> 00:42:51,404
and the moment I walked out in it,
it was game over.

529
00:42:51,406 --> 00:42:52,597
So you fell in love?

530
00:42:52,764 --> 00:42:55,010
I think your mom fell in love with me.

531
00:43:01,149 --> 00:43:02,149
It's true.

532
00:43:02,177 --> 00:43:03,177
- Really?
- Yeah.

533
00:43:06,138 --> 00:43:10,051
Did I tell you that having you around
makes me feel really safe?

534
00:43:11,183 --> 00:43:12,990
What? What did you say?

535
00:43:13,303 --> 00:43:16,456
Having you around
makes me feel really safe.

536
00:43:17,006 --> 00:43:18,752
I can't hear you. What?

537
00:43:18,777 --> 00:43:21,937
Having you around
makes me feel really safe.

538
00:43:22,224 --> 00:43:25,286
Gyeol, I can't hear you.
Louder. What was that?

539
00:43:25,311 --> 00:43:29,910
Having you around
makes me feel really safe.

540
00:43:31,123 --> 00:43:34,909
You make me really happy too.

541
00:43:42,964 --> 00:43:45,227
- Are you going to study hard?
- Yes.

542
00:43:51,743 --> 00:43:53,424
- Taking that to Han Gyu Yeong?
- Taking that to Gyu Yeong?

543
00:43:55,459 --> 00:43:56,462
No?

544
00:43:56,464 --> 00:43:57,923
- Don't lie.
- Don't lie.

545
00:43:59,918 --> 00:44:02,084
No, it's for me.

546
00:44:02,086 --> 00:44:03,911
- You're taking it to her.
- You're taking it to her.

547
00:44:06,829 --> 00:44:08,678
What were you going to say next?

548
00:44:09,716 --> 00:44:13,270
Heung Sik,
do you happen to like Gyu Yeong?

549
00:44:14,973 --> 00:44:17,406
No way.

550
00:44:17,584 --> 00:44:19,380
I was going to say that too.

551
00:44:21,417 --> 00:44:24,027
This is totally TV-worthy.

552
00:44:24,823 --> 00:44:27,924
Want to be on "Unbelievable Stories?"

553
00:44:27,926 --> 00:44:28,926
- No.
- No.

554
00:44:33,130 --> 00:44:34,130
Heung Sik.

555
00:44:35,166 --> 00:44:37,479
Do you really like Han Gyu Yeong?

556
00:44:39,377 --> 00:44:41,357
No. Absolutely not.

557
00:44:41,358 --> 00:44:43,297
That'll never happen.

558
00:44:44,577 --> 00:44:46,560
- Sounds like a lie.
- Suspicious, right?

559
00:45:11,443 --> 00:45:13,323
Fine. I'll lend it to you.

560
00:45:13,563 --> 00:45:15,712
Really? You're not lying?

561
00:45:15,930 --> 00:45:18,639
I swear on Han Gyu Rim's name,
I won't take your money and run.

562
00:45:18,664 --> 00:45:20,817
I'll pay you back for sure.

563
00:45:23,897 --> 00:45:25,367
You don't have to pay me back.

564
00:45:25,667 --> 00:45:28,631
But there's something
you have to do instead.

565
00:45:28,967 --> 00:45:30,150
Something I have to do? What?

566
00:45:30,457 --> 00:45:32,192
It's not "Eat trash" or "Drink sewage,"

567
00:45:32,298 --> 00:45:33,432
is it?

568
00:46:00,050 --> 00:46:02,090
Do you believe in telepathy?

569
00:46:02,316 --> 00:46:03,630
Not really?

570
00:46:09,697 --> 00:46:11,995
Good morning!

571
00:46:14,244 --> 00:46:16,254
Look at my twins having breakfast.

572
00:46:17,157 --> 00:46:18,990
That toast looks so good.

573
00:46:19,015 --> 00:46:20,335
Can I have one?

574
00:46:21,625 --> 00:46:22,931
Strawberry jam?

575
00:46:23,259 --> 00:46:25,478
But doesn't Gyu Seo like peach jam better?

576
00:46:26,404 --> 00:46:28,250
No, I hate peach jam.

577
00:46:28,518 --> 00:46:31,136
I see. Let me have this.

578
00:46:33,384 --> 00:46:36,365
I'm the one who likes peach jam.

579
00:46:40,899 --> 00:46:44,100
I know a bakery with insanely good bread.

580
00:46:44,234 --> 00:46:46,337
I'll go buy you some in a bit.

581
00:46:49,323 --> 00:46:51,897
Is that really Han Gyu Yeong
in front of us?

582
00:46:53,436 --> 00:46:54,989
Am I seeing things?

583
00:46:57,964 --> 00:47:00,756
Gyu Seo, you're getting more handsome
by the day.

584
00:47:00,830 --> 00:47:03,443
Your good looks are off the charts.

585
00:47:04,970 --> 00:47:07,771
And Gyu Min,
you're getting cuter and cuter.

586
00:47:07,909 --> 00:47:09,838
Isn't that way too much cuteness?

587
00:47:11,795 --> 00:47:13,224
Enjoy your breakfast.

588
00:47:13,249 --> 00:47:15,462
I'll text you after I get the bread.

589
00:47:19,578 --> 00:47:20,757
- Holy moly.
- Holy moly.

590
00:47:24,660 --> 00:47:25,930
How much are you knocking off?

591
00:47:33,464 --> 00:47:35,006
Only 100 dollars?

592
00:47:39,358 --> 00:47:40,610
Five hundred?

593
00:47:50,376 --> 00:47:51,376
Gyu Rim.

594
00:47:53,883 --> 00:47:55,687
Good morning.

595
00:47:57,239 --> 00:47:58,960
Don't you use body lotion?

596
00:47:58,985 --> 00:48:01,187
Don't you have dry skin like me?

597
00:48:03,504 --> 00:48:04,957
I knew it. Dry.

598
00:48:04,982 --> 00:48:07,897
Look how rough your skin is.
It's like dried pollock.

599
00:48:10,503 --> 00:48:13,183
Our skin's aging too, you know.

600
00:48:13,208 --> 00:48:15,128
Don't you take care of your skin?
Do you use body lotion?

601
00:48:15,343 --> 00:48:16,720
Want mine? Want to use mine?

602
00:48:17,997 --> 00:48:20,599
What's this? Why are you acting like this?
Did something happen?

603
00:48:21,557 --> 00:48:23,784
Something's always happening.

604
00:48:23,937 --> 00:48:25,539
Seriously, what's gotten into you?

605
00:48:26,037 --> 00:48:28,308
My heart drops
more than a dozen times a day,

606
00:48:29,685 --> 00:48:31,624
so slow down a little, Gyu Yeong.

607
00:48:32,331 --> 00:48:34,246
You're scaring me. What's going on?

608
00:48:36,131 --> 00:48:38,730
Okay. I'll slow down.

609
00:48:38,811 --> 00:48:40,537
How many kilometers per hour
works for you?

610
00:48:40,562 --> 00:48:42,462
Five? Ten?

611
00:48:46,103 --> 00:48:47,863
Just say the word.

612
00:49:02,531 --> 00:49:05,177
I feel sick.
I think I'm going to throw up.

613
00:49:11,531 --> 00:49:14,546
If someone offered you money,
you'd sell out your own country.

614
00:49:18,463 --> 00:49:21,252
I must've been a traitor in my past life.

615
00:49:22,674 --> 00:49:23,674
Money.

616
00:49:23,870 --> 00:49:25,020
My dear money.

617
00:49:25,677 --> 00:49:27,717
Money, my master.

618
00:49:33,307 --> 00:49:35,960
(Mom)

619
00:49:47,210 --> 00:49:49,670
Yes, this is Han Gyu Yeong.

620
00:49:51,197 --> 00:49:54,711
- It's Mom, Gyu Yeong.
- Yes.

621
00:49:55,636 --> 00:49:59,856
Can we meet for a bit when you have time?

622
00:50:02,824 --> 00:50:05,035
No, I don't want to.

623
00:50:05,848 --> 00:50:07,657
I don't want to get scolded anymore.

624
00:50:10,849 --> 00:50:12,689
I'm not going to scold you.

625
00:50:14,237 --> 00:50:19,964
I just want to feed you, Gyu Yeong.

626
00:50:28,919 --> 00:50:30,885
(Damga Charcoal Grill)

627
00:50:40,889 --> 00:50:42,491
Why are you here?

628
00:50:43,322 --> 00:50:44,635
Did you...

629
00:50:46,137 --> 00:50:48,210
Did you get kicked out because of me?

630
00:50:50,824 --> 00:50:53,237
Kicked out? Of course not.

631
00:50:53,571 --> 00:50:57,371
I just wanted to work
for myself, so I left.

632
00:50:58,616 --> 00:51:01,414
I'm too good to be stuck doing housework.

633
00:51:03,025 --> 00:51:05,610
Here, eat.

634
00:51:10,264 --> 00:51:12,837
Try it. It's really good.

635
00:51:27,638 --> 00:51:30,117
You should be scolding me.
Why are you giving me meat?

636
00:51:30,404 --> 00:51:32,877
I've done so many terrible things.

637
00:51:33,703 --> 00:51:35,863
I ruined your whole life.

638
00:51:36,091 --> 00:51:40,110
You should be smacking me.
Why are you grilling meat for me?

639
00:51:42,144 --> 00:51:44,850
You didn't ruin my life.

640
00:51:46,971 --> 00:51:48,177
I just...

641
00:51:49,943 --> 00:51:53,270
left because I wanted my own life back,

642
00:51:54,545 --> 00:51:57,240
and I'm happy with where I am now.

643
00:51:57,975 --> 00:52:02,277
I'm glad I can grill meat
for you like this,

644
00:52:04,143 --> 00:52:07,336
and that I get to see my daughter again.

645
00:52:12,810 --> 00:52:16,036
And I'll scold you for what you did wrong,
little by little.

646
00:52:16,098 --> 00:52:19,714
Because I'm your mom.

647
00:52:21,144 --> 00:52:23,884
When a child does something wrong,
you have to scold them.

648
00:52:24,916 --> 00:52:28,002
I'll take the blame for my mistakes too,

649
00:52:29,230 --> 00:52:31,509
and as for your mistakes,
little by little,

650
00:52:33,150 --> 00:52:34,803
as we go through life,

651
00:52:37,556 --> 00:52:40,822
I'll scold you, even with a switch
if I have to.

652
00:52:52,491 --> 00:52:53,717
Try it.

653
00:52:55,004 --> 00:52:56,511
Aren't you going to eat?

654
00:52:57,297 --> 00:52:59,204
My arm hurts.

655
00:53:10,097 --> 00:53:12,991
How is it? Good, right?

656
00:53:16,577 --> 00:53:17,892
It's good.

657
00:53:19,572 --> 00:53:21,679
It's so good.

658
00:53:23,523 --> 00:53:26,763
It's so good, it makes me mad.

659
00:53:31,398 --> 00:53:35,318
That I can taste how good the meat is
in a situation like this...

660
00:53:35,771 --> 00:53:37,783
makes me so mad.

661
00:53:38,304 --> 00:53:40,412
What's wrong with me?

662
00:53:43,010 --> 00:53:44,568
Please forgive me.

663
00:53:46,095 --> 00:53:48,169
I know it'll be hard,

664
00:53:50,344 --> 00:53:52,924
but please forgive me,
even just one percent.

665
00:54:00,662 --> 00:54:05,283
(Chairman Jang Hun Tae)

666
00:54:08,510 --> 00:54:10,707
I heard Han Gyu Yeong called you too, Dad?

667
00:54:10,869 --> 00:54:12,104
Saying she'd come here.

668
00:54:12,915 --> 00:54:17,916
Yeah. And I heard she called you
and told you to come to my office?

669
00:54:17,996 --> 00:54:22,633
Yes. I told her to come ready to get hit,
and she said she would.

670
00:54:24,070 --> 00:54:26,196
Do you have a club or a baseball bat?

671
00:54:33,996 --> 00:54:35,309
That must be Han Gyu Yeong.

672
00:54:35,957 --> 00:54:36,997
Yes.

673
00:54:37,336 --> 00:54:39,043
Ms. Han Gyu Yeong is here.

674
00:54:39,944 --> 00:54:41,110
Send her in.

675
00:54:46,797 --> 00:54:47,877
Come in.

676
00:54:58,917 --> 00:55:01,750
You're just begging to die, aren't you?

677
00:55:01,816 --> 00:55:03,854
Fine. You're getting
a beating from me today.

678
00:55:03,909 --> 00:55:06,329
- I'll teach you a real lesson.
- Seo Hyeon.

679
00:55:07,958 --> 00:55:09,071
Have a seat first.

680
00:55:16,424 --> 00:55:18,691
You're planning to divorce my mom,
aren't you?

681
00:55:19,370 --> 00:55:20,770
What's with you?

682
00:55:23,217 --> 00:55:26,863
You're planning to divorce her, right?

683
00:55:27,849 --> 00:55:32,240
That's why she's talking about doing
her own work or whatever,

684
00:55:32,708 --> 00:55:34,383
and staying away from home, isn't it?

685
00:55:36,777 --> 00:55:38,417
You met with Mom?

686
00:55:43,506 --> 00:55:45,511
I was wrong.

687
00:55:46,579 --> 00:55:48,707
I didn't know my place, I was ungrateful,

688
00:55:49,529 --> 00:55:51,420
and I acted out of line.

689
00:55:52,177 --> 00:55:54,843
All that talk about revenge was a lie,

690
00:55:55,137 --> 00:55:57,256
and saying I'd be more successful
than you, sir,

691
00:55:57,757 --> 00:55:59,737
that was all completely ridiculous...

692
00:56:01,051 --> 00:56:05,777
Anyway, nothing I said that day
was sincere.

693
00:56:06,944 --> 00:56:08,376
Who am I to dare...

694
00:56:09,084 --> 00:56:11,490
I'm not begging to die or anything.

695
00:56:14,357 --> 00:56:16,584
I feel like this is all my fault,

696
00:56:16,850 --> 00:56:20,453
so if you tell me to stay out of sight,

697
00:56:20,600 --> 00:56:24,210
I won't come within ten kilometers
of you or my mom.

698
00:56:24,504 --> 00:56:27,426
I'll delete your numbers. No,

699
00:56:27,927 --> 00:56:30,362
I'll change my number altogether.

700
00:56:31,570 --> 00:56:32,810
So,

701
00:56:34,617 --> 00:56:36,567
please, anything but a divorce.

702
00:56:37,542 --> 00:56:40,691
Please don't abandon my mom, sir.

703
00:56:44,283 --> 00:56:45,336
Gyu Yeong.

704
00:56:50,471 --> 00:56:51,822
Please don't do this, Gyu Yeong.

705
00:56:53,537 --> 00:56:54,784
Instead...

706
00:56:59,318 --> 00:57:01,492
- Sir.
- Dad.

707
00:57:02,523 --> 00:57:04,130
Let me ask you a favor.

708
00:57:06,490 --> 00:57:08,444
Please talk your mom out of it.

709
00:57:09,531 --> 00:57:13,772
Persuade her somehow
to take back what she said about divorce,

710
00:57:13,904 --> 00:57:17,944
and ask her not to leave me.

711
00:57:22,243 --> 00:57:26,210
I can't live without her.

712
00:57:27,750 --> 00:57:29,670
This isn't living.

713
00:57:30,777 --> 00:57:34,795
Waking up and eating every morning
in a house without my wife,

714
00:57:35,216 --> 00:57:40,016
and going to bed is so painful and hard.

715
00:57:41,010 --> 00:57:42,327
I tried...

716
00:57:43,556 --> 00:57:46,282
I tried my best to hide it
and tough it out,

717
00:57:47,662 --> 00:57:49,170
but I can't do it anymore.

718
00:57:52,517 --> 00:57:57,694
Sometimes it feels like
half of my body has been torn away,

719
00:57:59,395 --> 00:58:01,516
and sometimes I can't breathe.

720
00:58:04,864 --> 00:58:05,897
Gyu Yeong.

721
00:58:08,464 --> 00:58:11,371
I'm on my knees, begging you like this.

722
00:58:11,763 --> 00:58:13,330
You know what your mom's like, right?

723
00:58:14,184 --> 00:58:17,064
You know Ko Yun Hui.

724
00:58:18,204 --> 00:58:20,796
Once she makes up her mind,
she never changes it.

725
00:58:22,183 --> 00:58:25,796
I'm so scared she'll leave me
if this keeps up.

726
00:58:28,377 --> 00:58:32,268
This isn't your fault,

727
00:58:32,769 --> 00:58:37,217
so don't think that way.
Just stay right by your mom's side,

728
00:58:37,932 --> 00:58:41,863
and talk her out of it.

729
00:58:43,144 --> 00:58:45,330
Then I'll get on my knees
a hundred times if I have to.

730
00:58:48,249 --> 00:58:49,576
Will you do that for me?

731
00:59:06,556 --> 00:59:08,063
Coming back from a wedding?

732
00:59:08,857 --> 00:59:10,417
No, the department store.

733
00:59:10,442 --> 00:59:12,542
So the wedding
was at the department store?

734
00:59:13,957 --> 00:59:16,864
All dressed up like that,
you look like a tycoon's wife.

735
00:59:18,243 --> 00:59:22,210
Your clothes look expensive.
Aren't they due back at the dry cleaner's?

736
00:59:25,483 --> 00:59:27,289
Give this to your grandson.

737
00:59:27,576 --> 00:59:30,096
You said your grandson and mine
are about the same age.

738
00:59:31,470 --> 00:59:33,682
You got something for my grandson too?

739
00:59:34,837 --> 00:59:37,724
If you bought this at a department store,
it must've cost a fortune.

740
00:59:38,431 --> 00:59:40,910
I got it when I bought one for mine.

741
00:59:43,150 --> 00:59:45,096
People will think you're a tycoon.

742
00:59:46,757 --> 00:59:48,164
I am a tycoon.

743
00:59:48,816 --> 00:59:51,863
Sure, you're a tycoon, and I'm flat broke.

744
00:59:55,343 --> 00:59:57,061
- Seok Jung.
- Yeah?

745
00:59:58,403 --> 01:00:02,217
We agreed to share one secret each today,
remember?

746
01:00:02,551 --> 01:00:03,564
Yeah.

747
01:00:04,189 --> 01:00:07,022
Want to go first, or should I?

748
01:00:08,170 --> 01:00:12,596
Let's say it at the same time. On three.

749
01:00:13,836 --> 01:00:14,976
Okay.

750
01:00:17,071 --> 01:00:19,811
One, two, three.

751
01:00:20,138 --> 01:00:21,731
- I'm a tycoon.
- I'm dirt poor.

752
01:00:26,104 --> 01:00:28,463
Hey, don't joke around.

753
01:00:31,471 --> 01:00:36,424
Fine, okay. Then I'll go first, all right?

754
01:00:37,317 --> 01:00:42,737
Honestly, I'm way more broke
than you think.

755
01:00:43,710 --> 01:00:48,810
I checked my bank balance today.
I have 80 dollars.

756
01:00:55,457 --> 01:01:00,377
I'm Hong Ok Seon,
chairwoman of Dongyun Group.

757
01:01:11,789 --> 01:01:14,781
What? Come on, stop it.

758
01:01:15,794 --> 01:01:17,144
That's funny.

759
01:01:19,903 --> 01:01:21,858
What's with that face?

760
01:01:25,963 --> 01:01:27,616
If you don't believe me, look it up.

761
01:01:33,219 --> 01:01:34,777
What's with that face?

762
01:01:34,802 --> 01:01:36,854
Why are you so serious?

763
01:01:37,884 --> 01:01:40,326
I'm looking you up.

764
01:01:41,646 --> 01:01:42,663
Seriously.

765
01:01:43,670 --> 01:01:45,543
My stomach hurts!

766
01:02:11,814 --> 01:02:13,654
(Hong Ok Seon)

767
01:02:18,877 --> 01:02:20,027
Right?

768
01:02:29,857 --> 01:02:32,242
This is so hard. It weighs a ton.

769
01:02:48,411 --> 01:02:50,631
You scared me, ma'am.

770
01:02:50,657 --> 01:02:52,624
You nasty piece of work.

771
01:02:53,184 --> 01:02:56,044
What a disgustingly nasty piece of work.

772
01:02:56,884 --> 01:02:59,973
I came here to scold my son,

773
01:03:00,841 --> 01:03:03,497
but I'd better scold you first.

774
01:03:06,937 --> 01:03:09,083
Give this to Gyeol. It's a gift from me.

775
01:03:11,753 --> 01:03:13,026
Thanks, Yun Jin.

776
01:03:13,257 --> 01:03:15,252
And why do you keep sighing?

777
01:03:15,963 --> 01:03:18,983
I wasn't sighing.
I was just taking a deep breath.

778
01:03:27,404 --> 01:03:29,891
Who is that?
Why did Mu Jin run off so flustered?

779
01:03:30,104 --> 01:03:32,224
I'm not sure either.

780
01:03:33,830 --> 01:03:35,757
After poking around
and stirring things up,

781
01:03:36,352 --> 01:03:39,690
now you just show up wherever you like?

782
01:03:40,370 --> 01:03:42,077
I came to see Gyeol's mom.

783
01:03:43,984 --> 01:03:46,604
His biological mother.

784
01:03:46,643 --> 01:03:48,043
The woman who gave birth to him.

785
01:04:05,916 --> 01:04:08,762
Long time no see, Han Gyu Rim.

786
01:04:10,477 --> 01:04:11,937
How have you been?

787
01:04:15,516 --> 01:04:18,163
I got divorced a year and a half ago.

788
01:04:19,742 --> 01:04:21,549
Because I couldn't have children.

789
01:04:24,070 --> 01:04:26,489
My husband was an only son.

790
01:04:29,723 --> 01:04:34,389
I think I'm being punished
for abandoning Jeong Hyeon.

791
01:04:35,337 --> 01:04:40,417
I know I have no right to ask,

792
01:04:45,851 --> 01:04:47,244
but my son...

793
01:04:50,704 --> 01:04:52,477
Please give him back, Gyu Rim.

794
01:05:27,866 --> 01:05:30,399
(Love on the Menu)

795
01:05:30,424 --> 01:05:31,738
Then let's settle this in court.

796
01:05:31,844 --> 01:05:33,009
If this really goes to court,

797
01:05:33,043 --> 01:05:35,460
- you'll be a liability.
- He said he's my real dad.

798
01:05:35,485 --> 01:05:37,333
What's this all about now?

799
01:05:37,358 --> 01:05:39,860
So you deceived me with a kid
who isn't even your own blood?

800
01:05:39,885 --> 01:05:43,178
How could you do this to me
with a kid who isn't even yours?

801
01:05:43,244 --> 01:05:45,206
I just met Han Gyu O.

802
01:05:45,231 --> 01:05:48,071
He's the kind of guy
anyone would want as a son-in-law.

803
01:05:48,284 --> 01:05:49,998
Why do you keep following me?

804
01:05:50,023 --> 01:05:52,843
Jeong Hyeon? I'm your mother.

805
01:05:53,037 --> 01:05:55,464
I'm so sorry.

806
01:05:55,771 --> 01:05:58,835
But I'm a little scared.

807
01:06:00,602 --> 01:06:02,402
Dramaday.me
